      },
      "notes": "Apple borrowed the packaging idea from M-series Macs: the die and the memory sit side by side so memory is off the main heat path, and the chip bonds straight to a redesigned vapor chamber. Apple quotes up to 40 percent higher sustained performance. The CPU has two performance and four efficiency cores."
